# Testing & Validation

Read [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) §13 and Definition of Done.

**Backend (MM):** `cd backend && npm run test:architecture` after MM structural changes.

**Backend (general):** `npm run test` in `backend/` when touching tested domains.

**Frontend:** `npm run lint`, `npm run build` (or `next build`) when changing app routes or shared UI.

Report exactly which commands ran and their outcome. Do not state "tests passed" without execution.

For non-trivial changes: add or update tests when the repo already tests similar behavior.
